This plugin vendors one skill from Theo Browne's "tstack":

    https://github.com/t3dotgg/tstack

    skills/council/SKILL.md -> skills/council/SKILL.md

Upstream commit:

    11e37a74d0a6868c121cd0910ab2b3bd9873b92a

SKILL.md is the whole of the skill upstream. The rest of tstack is deliberately not
vendored: flow's stages already cover its PR, babysit and takeover skills.

LOCAL MODIFICATIONS
-------------------

None. SKILL.md is byte-for-byte upstream, and there is no patches/ directory. A local
change goes in as patches/0001-<slug>.patch, in the style of grill and unslop, and gets a
line here.

RE-SYNCING
----------

    1. Copy tstack/skills/council/SKILL.md over skills/council/SKILL.md
    2. Apply any patches under patches/ in order, from the repo root
    3. Update the commit SHA above

Verify by diffing against a fresh upstream copy: with no patches, the two files must be
byte-identical.

